{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://stegverse.org/schemas/endpoint-kind.v1.json",
  "title": "StegVerse InTr endpoint kind v1",
  "description": "Every InTr endpoint declares endpoint_kind and reuses the org InTr classes (INTR_MESH_PATH_TRANSFER, INTR_MESH_PATH_INGRESS / ORGANIZATION_INTR_DESTINATION_INGRESS; StegVerse-org/.github data/intr-protocol/v1/protocol.json). Rule (1): no endpoint chain is anchored on the org ledger. EPHEMERAL and PERMANENT keep their own ledger (REPOSITORY_LEDGER_INITIALIZATION genesis, stegverse.endpoint-ledger-genesis/v1); the anchor record is on that ledger and the Org records only its own digest-only crossing receipt. PERMANENT is designated on the node's own storage endpoint (NODE_STORAGE_ENDPOINT, the same way as STEGVERSE_KV; Q-PERMANENT-REPOSITORY-LEDGER, StegVerse-org/.github#167 comment 6374130335) and read only through llm_adapter.endpoint_ledger_designation; on an org GIT_REF it is DENY ENDPOINT_ORG_MEMBERSHIP_REFUSED, class A (#167 comment 6373412055 items 3 and 4); no node reader is documented (NODE_STORAGE_ENDPOINT_READER_NOT_DOCUMENTED). KV and SKAP_VAULT are STEGVERSE_KV:<location> designations with the cvk storage-endpoint keys (llm_adapter.endpoint_ledger_designation), never opened on an org ref. GATEWAY has no designated carrier ledger: refused (GATEWAY_CARRIER_LEDGER_NOT_DESIGNATED). Only EPHEMERAL dissolves (NODE_DISSOLUTION; disbursed to the Org Ledger as digest-only crossing receipts and read back; root inadmissible after). ORG is an organization's .github ledger: it issues anchors (issuer ORGANIZATION_LEDGER) and is never a node health root. Code: StegVerse-org/LLM-adapter llm_adapter.endpoint_ledger_anchor.",
  "$defs": {
    "endpoint_kind": {
      "enum": [
        "EPHEMERAL",
        "PERMANENT",
        "GATEWAY",
        "KV",
        "SKAP_VAULT",
        "ORG"
      ]
    }
  },
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "endpoint_kind",
    "ledger_model",
    "ledger_lifetime",
    "dissolves"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "stegverse.endpoint-kind/v1"
    },
    "endpoint_kind": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/endpoint_kind"
    },
    "ledger_model": {
      "enum": [
        "OWN_LEDGER",
        "NODE_STORAGE_ENDPOINT_DESIGNATION",
        "STEGVERSE_KV_DESIGNATION",
        "NOT_DESIGNATED",
        "ORGANIZATION_LEDGER"
      ]
    },
    "ledger_lifetime": {
      "enum": [
        "BOUNDED_UNTIL_DISSOLUTION",
        "UNBOUNDED"
      ]
    },
    "dissolves": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "node_kind": {
      "enum": [
        "StegApp",
        "StegBrowser",
        "StegNode"
      ]
    },
    "anchor": {
      "enum": [
        "NODE_LEDGER_OPENED_VIA_INTR_PATH_RECEIPT_PAIR",
        "INTR_PATH_RECEIPT_PAIR",
        "ENDPOINT_LEDGER_DESIGNATION",
        "REFUSED_GATEWAY_CARRIER_LEDGER_NOT_DESIGNATED",
        "NONE_IS_THE_ISSUER"
      ]
    }
  },
  "allOf": [
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "endpoint_kind": {
            "const": "EPHEMERAL"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "required": [
          "node_kind"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "ledger_model": {
            "const": "OWN_LEDGER"
          },
          "ledger_lifetime": {
            "const": "BOUNDED_UNTIL_DISSOLUTION"
          },
          "dissolves": {
            "const": true
          },
          "anchor": {
            "const": "NODE_LEDGER_OPENED_VIA_INTR_PATH_RECEIPT_PAIR"
          }
        }
      },
      "else": {
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "node_kind"
          ]
        },
        "properties": {
          "ledger_lifetime": {
            "const": "UNBOUNDED"
          },
          "dissolves": {
            "const": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "endpoint_kind": {
            "const": "PERMANENT"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "ledger_model": {
            "const": "NODE_STORAGE_ENDPOINT_DESIGNATION"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "const": "INTR_PATH_RECEIPT_PAIR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "endpoint_kind": {
            "enum": [
              "KV",
              "SKAP_VAULT"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "ledger_model": {
            "const": "STEGVERSE_KV_DESIGNATION"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "const": "ENDPOINT_LEDGER_DESIGNATION"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "endpoint_kind": {
            "const": "GATEWAY"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "ledger_model": {
            "const": "NOT_DESIGNATED"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "const": "REFUSED_GATEWAY_CARRIER_LEDGER_NOT_DESIGNATED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "endpoint_kind": {
            "const": "ORG"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "ledger_model": {
            "const": "ORGANIZATION_LEDGER"
          },
          "anchor": {
            "const": "NONE_IS_THE_ISSUER"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "authority_effect": "NONE_SCHEMA_ONLY"
}
